| `input_adb_lookup(lookupA.csv)`
| `input_adb_lookup(lookupB.csv)`
```### Map source lookup to source name ###```
| eval source=case(source_lookup="lookupA.csv", "lookupA", source_lookup="lookupB.csv", "lookupB")
```### Keep only the columns the merge uses ###```
| fields _time, source, source_lookup, priority, risk, score, owner, os
```### Create lookup specific fields for priority based coalesce ###```
| eval {source}_os = os
| search _key=*
| stats values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, max(_time) as last_seen, latest(_time) as _time, max(priority) as priority, min(risk) as risk, sum(score) as score__sum, count(score) as score__count, latest(owner) as owner, latest(lookupB_os) as lookupB_os, latest(lookupA_os) as lookupA_os by _key
```### Merge: only the keys go through adbmerge, the result is joined back by row id ###```
| `adb_merge(25, 50)`
```### Clusters that were too large to merge go to assetdb_overflow for review, not into assetdb ###```
| `adb_save_overflow`
| where isnull(adb_overflow)
| eval _key = md5(mvjoin(mvsort(asset), "::"))
| stats values(asset) as asset, values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, max(last_seen) as last_seen, `adb_counters`, max(priority) as priority, min(risk) as risk, sum(score__sum) as score__sum, sum(score__count) as score__count, latest(owner) as owner, latest(lookupB_os) as lookupB_os, latest(lookupA_os) as lookupA_os by _key
```### Calculate averages ###```
| eval score = score__sum / score__count
```### Define coalesce fields based on lookup priority ###```
| eval os = coalesce('lookupB_os', 'lookupA_os')
```### Run safety: how many assets did the last successful run produce? ###```
| `adb_run_guard(0.5)`
```### Record this run in assetdb_runs (the last 200 runs are kept) ###```
| `adb_record_run(0.5, 200)`
```### Only write the asset database when the run passed the safety check ###```
| `adb_write_gate`
```### Output to KV store ###```
| table _key, asset, source, source_lookup, last_seen, priority, risk, score, owner, os
| outputlookup override_if_empty=false assetdb
